{"id": "unknown-2026-07-08-035", "date": "2026-07-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "South Africa awards licenses to 1 GW of solar", "content": "<p>The four solar projects, with a contracted capacity of 890 MW and total installed capacity over 1 GW, represent the third addition to the seventh bid window of South Africa's procurement program for renewables.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/08/south-africa-awards-licenses-to-1-gw-of-solar/\">South Africa awards licenses to 1 GW of solar</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/08/south-africa-awards-licenses-to-1-gw-of-solar/", "type": "rss"}]}
