{"id": "unknown-2026-07-08-037", "date": "2026-07-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Water-jet delamination for solar module recycling", "content": "<p>Scientists have developed a new water-jet delamination recycling technology. They first separate the glass from the rest of the module, then process the rest. It achieved silver with 97% purity. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/08/water-jet-delamination-for-solar-module-recycling/\">Water-jet delamination for solar module recycling</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/08/water-jet-delamination-for-solar-module-recycling/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-08-038", "date": "2026-07-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["outperform", "[否定]loss"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "TÜV NORD study finds back-contact advantage over TOPCon is limited to mild shading conditions", "content": "<p>A TÜV NORD study found that back-contact (BC) modules outperform TOPCon modules under mild partial shading, particularly when three or fewer cells are shaded across different substrings within a string. However, once shading exceeds four cells, the performance advantage disappears, with both technologies experiencing similar power losses of around 50%.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/08/tuv-nord-study-confirms-back-contact-advantage-over-topcon-is-limited-to-mild-", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/08/tuv-nord-study-confirms-back-contact-advantage-over-topcon-is-limited-to-mild-shading-conditions/", "type": "rss"}]}
